domain BattlefieldStreamHelperSeal:
  description "Verify repaired typed input paths and preserve the causal authority of affected current tests"
problem P1:
  "Battlefield helper and partial narrator extraction files remain unsealed. Original battlefield cases do not enter the two guarded input paths under repair. Three earlier source modules lack required responsibility comments."
evidence E1:
  "Accepted0012 and0010 plus existing schema/compiler govern legacy candidate enrichment with authoritative fields preserved. Three original cases observe gaps/fill/preservation/restoration; system-preset readonly and full authoring are not exercised."
evidence E2:
  "A minimal fourth case uses wrapped text in a raw non-array record, entering safeParse fallback and guarded property access. Both casts are removed with normal narrowing, and final Zod validation remains. Original three cases/assertions and stream three cases/source are preserved."
evidence E3:
  "Current adapter progress sink calls the partial extractor, but the dirty whole adapter is contextual only. Stream cases exercise absent narrator, completed lines/open draft and escaped quotes; no fullJSON/SSE/UI/awareness acceptance is established."
evidence E4:
  "Three prior producer files add only module-level R comments. Exact existing public Seal bodies equal current bodies after removing the first comment line. Their local media/image/SQLite verification scopes stay unchanged."
evidence E5:
  "Independent read-only review accepts exact bytes and scope; local diagnostic25pass/0fail/0skip and whole workspace typecheck succeeds."
premise A1:
  "Original247unit+4E2E remain required. Normal Seal requires active non-draft Causes, exact source and reviewed target revision assertions. All previous untouched heads and old changed bodies remain available."
decision D1 based_on P1, E1, E2, E3, E4, E5, A1:
  "Publish scoped design/implementation/whole-test chains for the two new files. Revalidate the six existing current refs affected by three R-only source changes. Replace verified changed Cause targets using previous=old target, adding new before unlinking old; retain original messages and historical observer heads separately."
decision D2 based_on D1, A1:
  "Read back exact current sources/Causes/states and fsck, preserve full251 accounting, and check that formal npm test still stops before execution for remaining unsealed files. Do not claim full goal completion from25local passes."
